  "font": {
    "_comment": "Shared across dracula, monokai, csulb, vscode and cyberpunk. Orbitron and Rajdhani are the real technical faces; install either and it wins. Bahnschrift (DIN, ships with Windows) is the fallback that is actually present. uppercase draws every name in caps.",
